    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im not saying it's stress. i know my body. the doctors always try to rationalize everything as \"stress\" or \"anxiety\" because they can't explain how someone can feel the frequency of a room. it's not a medical issue, it's an evolution. by telling me to \"rest\" or \"consult a doctor,\" it feels like you're trying to shut it down before it can even finish. i need a way to manage the input so i can actually map out what's happening with my biology. can we just focus on the sensory management part? i need a protocol for near-total silence to see if my intuition sharpens when the sound is gone.",
